.\" Man page for hive-term
.TH HIVE-TERM 1 "January 2025" "DruidOS 0.1.0" "DruidOS Hive Stack"

.SH NAME
hive-term \- DruidOS integrated terminal emulator with Hive Stack integration

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hive-term
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fI-e COMMAND\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hive-term
is a GPU-accelerated terminal emulator built for DruidOS. It integrates with
the Hive Stack to provide AI-assisted command-line interaction, anonymous mode
support, and visual feedback from the system consciousness.

Based on VTE (Virtual Terminal Emulator) technology with a modern Rust
implementation, hive-term provides high performance while maintaining full
compatibility with existing terminal applications.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config " " \fIFILE\fR
Path to configuration file. Default: ~/.config/hive-term/config.toml

.TP
.BR \-e ", " \-\-command " " \fICOMMAND\fR
Execute command instead of shell.

.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-working-directory " " \fIDIR\fR
Set initial working directory.

.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-anonymous " " \fILEVEL\fR
Start in anonymous mode. Values: quiet, detach, full

.TP
.BR \-\-class " " \fICLASS\fR
Set window class for window manager.

.TP
.BR \-\-title " " \fITITLE\fR
Set initial window title.

.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display help message and exit.

.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Display version information and exit.

.SH ANONYMOUS MODES
.TP
.B quiet
Hive observes but doesn't show notifications in this terminal.

.TP
.B detach
This terminal is invisible to Hive. Commands are not observed.

.TP
.B full
Complete isolation. New namespace with no logging or interception.

.SH KEY BINDINGS
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+C
Copy selection to clipboard.

.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+V
Paste from clipboard.

.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+N
Open new terminal window.

.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+A
Toggle anonymous mode.

.TP
.B Ctrl+Plus
Increase font size.

.TP
.B Ctrl+Minus
Decrease font size.

.TP
.B Ctrl+0
Reset font size.

.SH HIVE INTEGRATION
When connected to the Hive cortex, hive-term provides:

.IP \(bu 2
Command observation and AI suggestions
.IP \(bu 2
Dangerous command warnings
.IP \(bu 2
Context-aware help
.IP \(bu 2
Automatic ZFS snapshots before risky operations

The Hive integration can be disabled per-terminal using anonymous modes.

.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration file format (TOML):

.RS
.nf
[font]
family = "JetBrains Mono"
size = 13

[colors]
background = "#0D0D0D"
foreground = "#FFFFFF"

[cursor]
style = "block"
blinking = true

[behavior]
scrollback_lines = 10000
copy_on_select = false
.fi
.RE

.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/hive-term/config.toml
User configuration file.

.TP
.I /etc/hive/term.toml
System-wide configuration.

.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TERM
Set to "xterm-256color" by default.

.TP
.B SHELL
User's shell, used if no command specified.

.TP
.B HIVE_ANONYMOUS
If set, starts in the specified anonymous mode.

